      <activity id="70a1de47-e6de-5eb3-9e8d-901061972b6d" activityNameId="39c09884-caae-5497-8b2e-5b882425d97b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fuel elements PWR, UO2 4.0% &amp; MOX, at nuclear fuel fabrication plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fuel elements PWR, UO2 4.0% &amp; MOX, at nuclear fuel fabrication plant
The shares are based on the current situation in Germany for the mix of UO2 and MOX fuels, assuming that 30% of the core of 8 PWRs are MOX and that at the beginning/end of the commercial operation of the reactors no MOX were/will be loaded. Hence, the indication of data validity inputted in "TimePeriod" only says that the shares represent the knowledge available today of the fuel management for German PWRs.;
UUID: 937aaab4-66c4-3270-97ff-70579c4180de
The module consists of the share of UO2 and MOX fuel elements.
Location: German conditions
Technology: Data reflects the use of UO2 and MOX fuel elements in current nuclear reactors.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_937aaab4-66c4-3270-97ff-70579c4180de.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
